flowchart TD
    A[Load synthetic release evidence] --> B[Run regression evaluation]
    B --> C[Validate skill contract mappings]
    C --> D[Replay historical decision records]
    D --> E[Compare baseline and candidate snapshots]
    E --> F[Aggregate check results and findings]
    F --> G{Any failed checks or HIGH-risk changes?}
    G -- Yes --> H[BLOCKED]
    G -- No --> I{Any MEDIUM-risk changes?}
    I -- Yes --> J[REVIEW_REQUIRED]
    I -- No --> K[READY_FOR_HUMAN_REVIEW]
    H --> L[Human reviews evidence; no deployment]
    J --> L
    K --> L
